# Keep the build context small and free of secrets/runtime data.
#
# NOTE: Docker matches bare names (no leading slash) at ANY level of the tree,
# so runtime-data directories MUST be anchored with a leading slash — a bare
# `storage` once excluded backend/app/storage/ and broke the container at
# runtime (ModuleNotFoundError: app.storage). Keep code dirs unmatchable.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
/storage
/data
/out
*.db
.env
*.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
